    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "Yes, it activates.",
        "question": "If I don't play a Digimon card, can the part after \"then\" in this card's [When Digivolving] effect activate?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "\"When [...] would leave the battle area other than by battle\" refers to when that Digimon is placed in the trash other than as a result of a battle, returned to the hand/deck, placed in the security stack, moved to the breeding area, or placed under another card.",
        "question": "What does this card's \"when [...] would leave the battle area other than by [...] a battle\" mean, exactly?",
        "reference": "[2]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, all of those Digimon are prevented from leaving.  This card's [All Turns] effect affects all Digimon without having to choose them.  In such cases, the effect triggers once when multiples of your Digimon with the [Angel], [Archangel], or [Three Great Angels] trait would leave the battle area at the same time other than by one of your effects or a battle, and by trashing the top card of your security stack, all of those Digimon are prevented from leaving.",
        "question": "If I activate this card's [All Turns] effect when multiples of my Digimon with the [Angel], [Archangel], or [Three Great Angels] trait would leave the battle area at the same time other than by one of my effects or a battle, are all of those Digimon prevented from leaving?",
        "reference": "[3]"
      }
    ]
  },
